<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-15T11:48:50.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:48:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits and Islamist fighters are intensifying attacks across northern Nigeria, killing an immigration officer in Niger, a traditional ruler in Plateau, and a Christian Red Cross volunteer in the northwest, while abducting farmers, a supervisory councillor, and other civilians in Niger, Kaduna and Zamfara. Boko Haram and ISWAP militants continue to strike military posts in Borno, causing soldiers to be feared killed. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPSzVwMnBIU0pSZFpjX0R2eEItQlByMEp4QmFJNWlHVlYyM01YUTlnUG12SGs5V3FldVpMUUZaM2VGb2VvVFlCR1VnNjMtZ29tY0dpRUo1Zm02dzV6Nks2dmRqTHQtR2JRLTEwQWh5bThVVFY2emY4ZW1ib2ZneVVsYlZwTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Maverick&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Businessday NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Daily Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNSEpjeFFINlFLVUNiWXJuSUh3X25DcDVEYnZsZUFkNXpWNXZKaXFUcERzTTVERVp2WlFmWDVBTktjWUkyZDdIRHRkUENYLTNial85SXVwVHRrZkVHMGE2SC1Ga3cwbHVYckVCOGdhVDFaV1pBeUlsTHFKWUZ1dGo2VEt0LTFqTGVWZXI4Mg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Whistler Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNVmJNWnhTekg5eXBNR0pCWFBqYjZiRHl4Q0djM0h0Vm9yY1hJVXJLVDBINHBaVUMwUGNMZ3BLenYtUWlLSnZGbEtZcXRKaEU5MWJLUWNvaURyMG5iNXZGWkNJaHZGOUdielpLdUFPOXhwMkNFN0I2YWlYTk1EMEpRalYwUHVBMm56RzQ1dFpFVTRQWVRrLVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOVktUSDUxWHFKTnZuV3dodl9rVzluMlBVUnZ1a2xveDhzNXAtN0FteFdCaDE2ZWZ6c2xUNzI3QkxZUWMtTF9BY1FodGIwMlFDWUw1LThBLW1KUlY2ejNNNjNMVmVoX1V2VkNIZUZzbHNGRmh